WEBVTT

1
00:00:19.201 --> 00:00:19.761
wake up!"

2
00:00:19.981 --> 00:00:20.741
called Wukong.

3
00:00:21.661 --> 00:00:23.682
The travelers had camped for a night in the woods.

4
00:00:25.662 --> 00:00:27.383
Tang Monk woke up and stretched.

5
00:00:29.383 --> 00:00:32.584
Wujing opened his eyes and yawned.

6
00:00:32.864 --> 00:00:34.945
moaned, "It's too early.

7
00:00:35.726 --> 00:00:37.967
Let me sleep just a few more hours."

8
00:00:40.728 --> 00:00:43.009
"Bajie, don't be lazy," said the Tang Monk.

9
00:00:44.009 --> 00:00:44.730
time to get up.

10
00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:46.771
Please start making breakfast."

11
00:00:49.112 --> 00:00:50.472
pig got to his feet.

12
00:00:50.512 --> 00:00:53.614
"All we do is work," he said.

13
00:00:54.414 --> 00:00:58.076
"Cook food carry bags walk, walk, walk!"

14
00:01:00.908 --> 00:01:03.289
"We're on a noble mission," said Wujing.

15
00:01:03.309 --> 00:01:08.352
"Because of our difficult journey, the Tang Empire will have the True Scriptures.

16
00:01:09.092 --> 00:01:12.754
You should be happy to do all this work."

17
00:01:14.355 --> 00:01:16.937
After a quick breakfast, the group started walking.

18
00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:20.979
They went through a valley and over some hills.

19
00:01:29.323 --> 00:01:31.416
Later that afternoon they heard yelling.

20
00:01:31.436 --> 00:01:34.998
"It sounds like some people are in trouble," said the Tang Monk.

21
00:01:35.658 --> 00:01:36.598
Wujing nodded.

22
00:01:36.618 --> 00:01:39.079
"Yes. I wonder what's going on."

23
00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:42.041
all wait here," said Wukong.

24
00:01:42.061 --> 00:01:43.981
"I'll go and investigate."

25
00:01:45.362 --> 00:01:47.763
The monkey leaped into the air and looked around.

26
00:01:50.504 --> 00:01:54.386
He saw a group of Buddhist monks pushing a cart up a steep hill.

27
00:01:55.366 --> 00:01:57.547
cart was loaded with big stones.

28
00:01:58.567 --> 00:02:01.412
The monks looked miserable.

29
00:02:01.472 --> 00:02:03.154
Their robes were dirty and ripped.

30
00:02:04.355 --> 00:02:06.136
Daoist priests stood nearby.

31
00:02:06.877 --> 00:02:08.778
They were dressed in fine clothes.

32
00:02:10.199 --> 00:02:11.020
"Work faster!"

33
00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:12.401
yelled one of the priests.

34
00:02:13.602 --> 00:02:15.003
Buddhists looked frightened.

35
00:02:16.044 --> 00:02:18.526
They struggled to move the cart faster.

36
00:02:19.707 --> 00:02:21.608
"Why are those monks pushing that cart?"

37
00:02:21.849 --> 00:02:22.709
thought Wukong.

38
00:02:22.729 --> 00:02:25.672
"And why are they scared of the Daoists?"

39
00:02:30.688 --> 00:02:33.170
The monkey waited for the Daoists to leave.

40
00:02:34.271 --> 00:02:36.932
Then he made himself look like a Buddhist monk.

41
00:02:41.576 --> 00:02:44.338
said Wukong, walking toward the group of monks.

42
00:02:44.358 --> 00:02:46.379
"Why are you pushing this cart?"

43
00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:50.762
The monks stopped pushing the cart and turned toward Wukong.

44
00:02:51.643 --> 00:02:53.024
They looked surprised.

45
00:02:53.044 --> 00:02:56.066
"You must be new here," one monk said.

46
00:02:56.086 --> 00:02:59.248
"You should leave before you're discovered."

47
00:03:00.492 --> 00:03:02.073
"Why?" asked Wukong.

48
00:03:02.093 --> 00:03:06.055
"Daoists are in charge here," said another monk.

49
00:03:06.835 --> 00:03:07.755
Wukong shrugged.

50
00:03:07.775 --> 00:03:10.917
"People from different religions can still get along."

51
00:03:10.937 --> 00:03:14.818
"Not in this kingdom," said the first monk.

52
00:03:15.939 --> 00:03:17.299
are treated horribly here.

53
00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:20.000
The Daoists make us do hard work."

54
00:03:21.241 --> 00:03:23.522
"Why do the Daoists treat you so badly?"

55
00:03:23.822 --> 00:03:24.582
asked Wukong.

56
00:03:24.602 --> 00:03:28.104
"Years ago this kingdom had a drought," said the monk.

57
00:03:29.492 --> 00:03:31.313
"Crops died and people starved.

58
00:03:32.693 --> 00:03:34.434
monks prayed to Buddha for rain.

59
00:03:35.054 --> 00:03:36.134
But no rain came."

60
00:03:38.435 --> 00:03:41.636
"One day a powerful Daoist arrived," said the other monk.

61
00:03:42.696 --> 00:03:44.277
"He's called the Tiger Immortal.

62
00:03:45.137 --> 00:03:47.618
He recited prayers, and right away rain fell.

63
00:03:49.598 --> 00:03:51.599
Since then Daoists have been in charge.

64
00:03:52.539 --> 00:03:55.460
They destroyed all the Buddhist monasteries and statues."

65
00:03:59.384 --> 00:04:01.165
terrible," said Wukong.

66
00:04:01.185 --> 00:04:03.506
"Those Daoists can't get away with this."

67
00:04:04.907 --> 00:04:07.728
"The Daoists won't treat us this way forever," said a third monk.

68
00:04:07.748 --> 00:04:11.649
"The spirit of the planet Venus visited us in a dream one night.

69
00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:15.131
He said that one day someone would come along to save us."

70
00:04:17.012 --> 00:04:19.733
really?" Wukong raised an eyebrow.

71
00:04:19.753 --> 00:04:22.014
"Who is going to save you?"

72
00:04:23.234 --> 00:04:25.215
fierce monkey spirit," said the monk.

73
00:04:25.235 --> 00:04:28.232
"His name is Sun Wukong.

74
00:04:28.292 --> 00:04:31.334
He is so powerful that Heaven's entire army couldn't defeat him!"

75
00:04:33.476 --> 00:04:34.657
Wukong smiled.

76
00:04:34.677 --> 00:04:37.499
"I've heard of Sun Wukong.

77
00:04:38.279 --> 00:04:40.141
And it's true that he's very powerful.

78
00:04:40.921 --> 00:04:42.402
Did Venus tell you what he looks like?"

79
00:04:43.563 --> 00:04:44.904
"Oh yes," said the monk.

80
00:04:46.305 --> 00:04:48.146
you'll recognize him if you see him?"

81
00:04:48.446 --> 00:04:50.588
asked Wukong, trying not to laugh.

82
00:04:52.389 --> 00:04:52.970
said the monk.

83
00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:56.620
"Why do you ask?"

84
00:04:57.161 --> 00:04:58.542
sparkled around Wukong.

85
00:04:59.123 --> 00:05:01.245
A moment later he was a monkey again.

86
00:05:03.006 --> 00:05:05.008
Wukong!" cried the monks.

87
00:05:06.029 --> 00:05:07.911
They all fell to their knees and
